<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Friday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK			  RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			     3-mths	  6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	 11.50 /11.35  12.10 /11.95   12.70 /12.50</p>
<p>BPI			 11.525/11.45  12.025/11.95   12.525/12.425</p>
<p>Citibank		  11.70 /11.55  12.20 /12.05   12.625/12.55</p>
<p>Metrobank		 11.50 /11.25  11.80 /11.60   12.40 /12.25</p>
<p>Multinational	   11.70 /11.40  12.30 /11.90   12.725/12.50</p>
<p>PCIBank		   11.55 /11.45  12.00 /11.85   12.50 /12.35</p>
<p>PNB			 11.50 /11.40  12.05 /11.90   12.55 /12.40</p>
<p>Solidbank		 11.55 /11.475 12.075/12.00   12.60 /12.525</p>
<p>StanChart		 11.60 /11.50  12.15 /12.05   12.575/12.45</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
